The Software estimates nutrition information using AI models and third-party
databases. Those estimates are approximate and often inaccurate. The Software
is not medical, nutritional or dietary advice, is not a medical device, and
must not be relied upon for diagnosing, treating or managing any health
condition, nor for identifying allergens. Consult a qualified professional
before making dietary decisions.

